---
import { siteConfig } from "../../data/site";

interface Props {
  class?: string;
}

const { class: className = "" } = Astro.props;
---

<section class={`py-14 md:py-20 bg-[#F8F9FA] text-gray-900 border-t border-gray-200/80 overflow-hidden ${className}`}>
  <div class="max-w-[76rem] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-center">
      <!-- Text Column: Below photo on mobile (order-2), Left on desktop (lg:order-1) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-maroon-50 text-maroon-700 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 border border-maroon-100">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-maroon-700"></span>
            <span>Pusat Magang Informatika Malang</span>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-[2.65rem] font-extrabold text-gray-900 leading-[1.18] tracking-tight">
            Magang Informatika Seharusnya <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
            <span class="text-maroon-700">Tidak Rumit</span> &amp; Berdampak Nyata
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Banyak siswa SMK (RPL, TKJ, Multimedia), mahasiswa teknik informatika, dan institusi pendidikan di Kota Malang dan sekitarnya menghadapi keraguan saat mencari tempat magang: tugas yang tidak relevan dengan teknologi, minimnya arahan dari praktisi senior, hingga ketidakjelasan sertifikasi resmi.
          </p>
          <p>
            Di <strong>{siteConfig.name}</strong> yang berpusat di area strategis {siteConfig.address.street} {siteConfig.address.city}, Anda tidak perlu berspekulasi dengan masa depan karier Anda. Kami hadir dengan komitmen transparansi mutlak, kurikulum proyek industri IT terstruktur, pembinaan coding & arsitektur sistem, serta penugasan nyata berstandar industri.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature Bullets -->
        <div class="pt-2 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5 text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-maroon-100 text-maroon-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shrink-0">✓</span>
            <span>Silabus Praktik Sesuai DUDI</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-maroon-100 text-maroon-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shrink-0">✓</span>
            <span>Bimbingan 1-on-1 Mentor Senior</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-maroon-100 text-maroon-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shrink-0">✓</span>
            <span>MoU Resmi Sekolah &amp; Kampus</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-maroon-100 text-maroon-700 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shrink-0">✓</span>
            <span>100% Bebas Biaya Pendaftaran</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA Button to Tentang Page -->
        <div class="pt-3">
          <a
            href="/tentang/"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-maroon-700 hover:bg-maroon-800 text-white font-extrabold text-xs md:text-sm shadow-md shadow-maroon-950/20 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all group"
          >
            <span>Pelajari Profil Selengkapnya</span>
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white/20 group-hover:bg-white/30 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs transition-colors">
              →
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Photo Column: On top on mobile (order-1), Right on desktop (lg:order-2) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center order-1 lg:order-2">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-md group">
          <!-- Organic frame shadow -->
          <div class="absolute -inset-2 bg-gradient-to-tr from-maroon-950 via-maroon-900 to-black rounded-[36px] opacity-20 blur-lg transition-all duration-500 group-hover:opacity-30"></div>
          
          <div class="relative rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden bg-white p-3.5 border border-gray-200/90 shadow-2xl">
            <div class="aspect-[4/3] rounded-[24px] overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 relative">
              <img
                src="/images/galeri/galeri-1.webp"
                alt="Suasana Pendampingan Mentor Praktisi Gemilang Training"
                width="800"
                height="600"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
            <!-- Floating badge caption on frame -->
            <div class="pt-3.5 pb-1 px-3 text-center">
              <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-extrabold text-maroon-700 block mb-0.5">
                Bimbingan Nyata di Lini Kerja
              </span>
              <p class="text-[0.75rem] text-gray-500">
                Mentor praktisi industri mendampingi pemecahan masalah dan pengarahan langsung 1-on-1.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
